 menu.\n\nNote: Due to changes in how courses are stored, some courses will need to be downloaded again after this update.\n\n## \ud83d\udcc8 Performance Optimizations:\nWe've been under the hood tuning performance, and you'll feel it the moment you tee off.\n- Optimized networking code to reduce stuttering frames while you get ready to hit a shot.\n- Lightened the UI so its smoother and faster to show and hide.\n- Optimized how and when the UI draws to significantly improve graphics performance.\n- Simplified UI animations on Q2 to improve graphics performance while the HDUI is off.\n- Improved how the game loads courses and textures to reduce overall memory use and load times.\n- Made the loading image visible for the entire time so you're not stuck in the dark.\n\n### This all leads to:\n- Smoother shots and putts so your swing stays fluid from takeaway to finish.\n- Better performance on demanding courses which now play much more smoothly.\n- Ball roll is now lag and stutter free.\n", "created_date": 1793216508, "id": "28729524243382949", "version": "818.01", "version_code": 150853, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 116}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2412327085529357", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28729450523390321"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2309851355956647"}]}, "change_log": "## Update v818.01 is Live!\n\n## New Feature: Course Download Management\nSave space on your headset by downloading only the courses you need, when you need them.\n- On-Demand Downloads: Courses automatically download when you start or join a game, or you can download them manually.\n- Free Up Storage: Remove courses you're not using to reclaim space on your headset.\n- Smaller Game Install: Get into GOLF+ faster with a smaller initial download.\n- Storage Management: View and manage your downloaded courses from the new Storage menu.\n\nNote: Due to changes in how courses are stored, some courses will need to be downloaded again after this update.\n\n## \ud83d\udcc8 Performance Optimizations:\nWe've been under the hood tuning performance, and you'll feel it the moment you tee off.\n- Optimized networking code to reduce stuttering frames while you get ready to hit a shot.\n- Lightened the UI so its smoother and faster to show and hide.\n- Optimized how and when the UI draws to significantly improve graphics performance.\n- Simplified UI animations on Q2 to improve graphics performance while the HDUI is off.\n- Improved how the game loads courses and textures to reduce overall memory use and load times.\n- Made the loading image visible for the entire time so you're not stuck in the dark.\n\n### This all leads to:\n- Smoother shots and putts so your swing stays fluid from takeaway to finish.\n- Better performance on demanding courses which now play much more smoothly.\n- Ball roll is now lag and stutter free.\n", "created_date": 1793216197, "id": "28729450523390321", "version": "818.01", "version_code": 150852, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 116}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2412327085529357", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28729450523390321"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1793143805, "id": "28717525957916111", "version": "818.01", "version_c